{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X的大字能直接串起离开是为了不再受委屈、怀念被当作自己人的日子、害怕孤单却不愿回去忍让，最后带着想念继续生活的完整拉扯；Y反复使用分寸、归属、自持等抽象概念，关键因果和选择不够清楚。small：Y的小字与旁注分工更清楚，身体感受和音乐线索大多能补充对应的大块；X有些感受在音乐描写和人物体验之间切换，衔接稍散。concise：X的叙事推进更有新信息，Y多次重复把心思收回来、疲惫后的松弛、守住分寸等意思。human：X整体更接近日常说话，Y的松开自持、没有把他的注意从眼前完全带走、清楚而带着距离的珍惜等搭配偏生硬，有书面摘要腔。fine：X留下的体验更具体、辨识度更高，如整理衣服再抬头、脑子里停不下来的如果当时、回忆无法陪他面对以后；Y较多使用疲惫、安静、向前感、珍惜等概括性表达。load：X的大字多为较短的自然意群，虽然数量有时较多，但整体扫读负担较小；Y有些短时屏幕堆叠了多个较长的大块，例如S03、S04，阅读压力相对更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "194681ba-6f93-4443-8037-322fadda5e7e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T091829132210Z", "elapsed_seconds": 369.36, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T09:24:38.502096+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "92caf04ff64733f7698e929049f9a87c9b09b7c9bcc1eeac78eecb8cd59ae55f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_